    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorLocalFallbackUnavailable">Metadata AI tried to use the free local fallback, but no local provider was available.

Check that LM Studio has the local server active at http://localhost:1234 or that Ollama is running at http://localhost:11434.

